{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06310","headline":"田家即事 · 祖咏","name":"田家即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧居东臯上，左右俯荒村。\n樵路前傍岭，田家遥对门。\n欢娱始披拂，惬意在郊原。\n余霁荡川雾，新秋仍昼昏。\n攀条憩林麓，引水开泉源。\n稼穑岂云倦，桑麻今正繁。\n方求静者赏，偶与潜夫论。\n鸡黍何必具，吾心知道尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}